  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "deko is user table 8 or 9 ha user id ha lakin  memebership table wala ma
      kahi bhi group number 8 and 11  aor usko user id nahi mila ga . meaning ya
      user id 8 or 9 wala kisi whatsup group ka part nahi ha sidi life ji raha
      ha "
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: yadi aap membership table a deko 5 or 6 name ka koi user hi nahi ha deko
      khuj tho gadbad hua ha jis sa dikaya ja raha ha ki hamra user id 5 and 6
      group number 1 k part ha ha lakin jasa hi hum unka information nikalna ja
      raha ha agra en user ka information tho exist hi nahi karta ha deko ho
      sakta ha en user na account banya hoga group join kiya hoga  lakin account
      delete kar diya hoga . lakin hamara database design bhut hi kharab tha.
      haman unko user wala sa delete kar diya lakin hum usko membership wala sa
      remove nahi kar paya jiski waja sa ya anomly ha
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "we learn how to write sql join query        \r

      first we do the cross join with users and group wala table now 7*4 = 28
      rows milga we answer the question hamra har ek user kitna group ka part
      ban sakta ha"
