    value: "## Q: find order name and corresponding category name"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: ya question solve karna ka liya huma 3 baar joins karna hoga .
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: deko 1 order have multiples items aor deko har ek item ki category hogi.
